#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode-operation.rst:10
#: 632674efc614477d877468971f56a879
msgid ""
"System Identification Mode (SYSID mode) provides a rapid means to develop"
" highly accurate flight dynamics models (also known as Digital Twin) "
"using flight test data. These models generated by actual vehicle data can"
" then be used for math-model validation and improvement (if one is "
"already available), or they can replace the existing model entirely. "
"Tuning of the control laws including simulation of the closed-loop "
"vehicle response can also be done."
msgstr ""
"系统辨识模式（SysID "
"模式）提供了一种利用飞行测试数据快速建立高精度飞行动力学模型（也称数字孪生）的方法。由实际飞行器数据生成的模型可用于数学模型验证和改进（若已有模型），或完全替代现有模型。还可进行控制律调参，包括闭环飞行器响应仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode-operation.rst:14
#: e52ae6593fd54f27917c829c2ebb8c3d
msgid ""
"The models and associated control law analysis are invaluable in "
"demonstrating required stability metrics as part of airworthiness "
"certifications."
msgstr "这些模型及相关控制律分析在证明适航认证所需的稳定性指标方面具有重要价值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode-operation.rst:17
#: 8b2a5cc7c1514205be131270b8cb1e62
msgid ""
"This flight mode produces a data set of stimulus (excitation) signals and"
" measured responses that are recorded in the data flash log. These "
"signals are injected and collected at specific parts of the autopilot "
"depending on the purpose of the model being created. The injected signal "
"(\"chirp\") propagates through the autopilot control structures until "
"they are output to physical actuators that cause the vehicle to react to "
"the injected signals. The frequency sweep and amplitude of the \"chirp\" "
"can be set by parameters, as well as the injection point."
msgstr "此飞行模式生成激励（扫频）信号和测量响应的数据集，记录到数据闪存日志中。这些信号根据所建模型的目的注入并采集于飞控的特定部位。注入的信号（「chirp」）通过飞控控制结构传播，直至输出到使飞行器对注入信号产生反应的物理执行器。「chirp」的频率扫描范围和幅值可通过参数设置，注入点也可配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode-operation.rst:22
#: a32b8c63b0754e49ab93b77fc2fd9cb5
msgid ""
"The vehicle's electrical/mechanical reactions are then monitored by the "
"internal sensors of the autopilot and logged. By recording the output of "
"these sensors and comparing them to the stimulus (injected \"chirp\" "
"signals) the engineer can gain insight into the electrical/mechanical "
"properties and interactions of the aircraft."
msgstr ""
"飞行器的电气/机械响应随后由飞控内部传感器监测并记录。通过记录这些传感器的输出并与激励信号（注入的 「chirp」 "
"信号）对比，工程师可以深入了解飞行器的电气/机械特性及相互作用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode-operation.rst:27
#: 5d2dc3e381f74f1d8d42d71bf1cbdba4
msgid "Data Collection"
msgstr "数据采集"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode-operation.rst:29
#: f0e1358d18ac4e639c16fc8d8a35e18c
msgid ""
"The data collection is initiated by switching to the System ID mode. Each"
" time the mode is changed to the System ID flight mode a new data "
"collection is initiated. To change the amplitude of the excitation, the "
":ref:`SID_MAGNITUDE<SID_MAGNITUDE>` parameter can be tuned using the "
"transmitter during the data collection using :ref:`common-transmitter-"
"tuning` and setting the :ref:`TUNE<TUNE>` parameter in Copter, or the "
":ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` in Plane, to \"58\" ."
msgstr ""
"切换到系统辨识模式时开始数据采集。每次切换到系统辨识飞行模式都会启动一次新的数据采集。可在数据采集期间使用遥控器通过 :ref:`common-"
"transmitter-tuning` 调节 :ref:`SID_MAGNITUDE<SID_MAGNITUDE>` 参数来改变激励幅值，并在 "
"Copter 中将 :ref:`TUNE<TUNE>` 参数或在 Plane 中将 :ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` "
"设置为 「58」。"

